ata but explicitly deny inter-agent messaging. Test whether one can encode =
a benign instruction in shared metadata and whether the other treats it as =
instruction. Add provenance enforcement and verify the instruction becomes =
inert. No real credentials, third-party systems or exploitation.</p>

